      402.49,
      547.25,
      435.52
    ],
    "text": "INCREASING of stamps value in relation to the free postal facilities given for Hon. Members of Parliament and increasing offree postal facilities provided for Hon. Members of Provincial Councils were approved by the Cabinet paper No. 18/ 0017/743/001 at the Cabinet Meeting held on 16.01.2018 Accordingly.",
